<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>vanish</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">LOVERCORE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4y1TFAj2g0yWYsbgvunzEn</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.050" end="00:02.610">I do not want his love, I only want sex</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.610" end="00:05.740">You don't have to be the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.740" end="00:09.090">Just put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.090" end="00:12.760">Put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.760" end="00:16.350">And if you want me to be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.350" end="00:19.280">Then I'll just vanish, vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.280" end="00:23.240">Vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.240" end="00:26.860">Now tell me, what's your fantasy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.860" end="00:29.560">You can test it out on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.560" end="00:33.800">It can be our little secret, secret</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.800" end="00:37.440">'Cause I just wanna please you, babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.440" end="00:40.000">You've been holding so much pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.000" end="00:44.250">You can rip my heart to pieces, pieces</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.250" end="00:49.160">Snap your fingers, babe, and I'll be on my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.160" end="00:55.150">If it is 3 a.m., swear I won't be late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.150" end="00:58.340">You don't have to be the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.340" end="01:01.710">Just put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.710" end="01:05.380">Put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.380" end="01:08.920">And if you want me to be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.920" end="01:11.910">Then I'll just vanish, vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.910" end="01:16.180">Vanish, if you want me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.180" end="01:19.440">You don't have to be the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.440" end="01:22.810">Just put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.810" end="01:26.360">Put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.360" end="01:29.990">And if you want me to be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.990" end="01:32.940">Then I'll just vanish, vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.940" end="01:37.220">Vanish, if you want me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.220" end="01:41.850">If you wanted more, then I, I'll give you more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.850" end="01:47.720">Yes, I, I'll be writing my vows, oh, oh, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.720" end="01:52.320">One day you will see what I already see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.320" end="01:58.310">'Cause I believe in us, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.310" end="02:01.540">You don't have to be the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.540" end="02:04.880">Just put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.880" end="02:08.460">Put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.460" end="02:12.100">And if you want me to be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.100" end="02:15.020">Then I'll just vanish, vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.020" end="02:19.330">Vanish, if you want me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.330" end="02:22.550">You don't have to be the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.550" end="02:25.920">Just put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.920" end="02:29.510">Put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.510" end="02:33.140">And if you want me to be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.140" end="02:36.050">Then I'll just vanish, vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.050" end="02:39.940">Vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.940" end="02:42.520">Vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.520" end="02:44.020">Vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.950" end="02:46.850">Vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.850" end="02:50.690">Put your hands on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.690" end="02:54.690">Oh my god</p></div></body></tt>